[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 421.67, "timestamp": "00:07:01", "text": "呃，这个我在推特上看到的东西。 它的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 423.589, "timestamp": "00:07:03", "text": "名字听起来像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 427.27, "timestamp": "00:07:07", "text": "CC Cleaner 的替代品。  [音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 430.71, "timestamp": "00:07:10", "text": "我想节省一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 433.749, "timestamp": "00:07:13", "text": "电脑空间。 我刚刚下载了一个叫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 437.909, "timestamp": "00:07:17", "text": "什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 442.15, "timestamp": "00:07:22", "text": "呃，漂白剂那部分。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 445.589, "timestamp": "00:07:25", "text": "我的电脑好像死机了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 447.589, "timestamp": "00:07:27", "text": "整整10分钟。 这就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 450.23, "timestamp": "00:07:30", "text": "今天直播迟到的原因。 比如，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 453.909, "timestamp": "00:07:33", "text": "原本应该晚上10点开始。 虽然很机敏，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 457.83, "timestamp": "00:07:37", "text": "但我还是因为这个稍微迟到了一会儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 459.589, "timestamp": "00:07:39", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 462.07, "timestamp": "00:07:42", "text": "电脑突然死机了，我就想：“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 465.67, "timestamp": "00:07:45", "text": "我的天哪，我直播要迟到了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 472.87, "timestamp": "00:07:52", "text": "[笑声和倒吸气声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 476.95, "timestamp": "00:07:56", "text": "我刚刚重启了电脑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 479.43, "timestamp": "00:07:59", "text": "我的天啊。"}]